sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Người dùng
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant VM as WorkspaceViewModel
    participant Repo as ReviewRepository
    participant API as ReviewApi
    participant Http as ApiService
    participant Proxy as FastAPI proxy
    participant Limit as RateLimiter
    participant Cache as LRU cache
    participant Gemini as Gemini provider
    participant Verify as QuoteVerifier
    participant Store as SessionStore

    User->>UI: Chọn unit + Review
    UI->>VM: runReview()
    VM->>VM: clamp selection to 60
    VM->>Repo: run(filtered document, concurrency=4)
    activate Repo
    Repo->>Repo: retry retryable errors per unit, max 3 attempts
    Repo->>Repo: 401/429 kills run
    Repo->>Repo: create workers (tối đa 4)

    par worker 1
        Repo->>API: review(unit 1, text, section, page, image?)
    and worker 2
        Repo->>API: review(unit 2, text, section, page, image?)
    and worker 3
        Repo->>API: review(unit 3, text, section, page, image?)
    and worker 4
        Repo->>API: review(unit 4, text, section, page, image?)
    end

    API->>Http: POST /review
    Http->>Proxy: request + X-App-Token + X-User-Id
    Proxy->>Limit: check(user, 50/day)
    alt quota đã hết
        Limit-->>Proxy: 429
        Proxy-->>Http: 429 + Retry-After
        Http-->>API: ApiException(non-retryable)
        API-->>Repo: kill run
    else quota còn
        Limit-->>Proxy: allowed
        Proxy->>Cache: lookup(exact key)
        alt cache hit
            Cache-->>Proxy: ReviewResult cached
            Proxy-->>Http: result
        else cache miss
            Proxy->>Gemini: generate_json(review prompt + optional image)
            Gemini-->>Proxy: structured JSON
            Proxy->>Verify: review_issues(quotes, source, threshold=0.92)
            Verify-->>Proxy: kept issues + dropped count
            Proxy->>Cache: put(exact key, ReviewResult)
            Proxy-->>Http: ReviewResult
        end
        Http-->>API: ReviewResult
        API-->>Repo: result
    end

    opt có image và image path lỗi
        Repo->>API: review same unit without image
        API-->>Repo: text-only result hoặc failure
    end
    Repo->>Repo: aggregate results + failures + coverage
    Repo-->>VM: ReviewProgress events
    VM->>VM: update unit statuses
    VM->>Store: save session + snapshot
    Store-->>VM: persisted
    Repo-->>UI: done / cancelled / failed
    deactivate Repo
